    values:originalText "Insert: law enforcement agency has the same meaning as in the Surveillance Devices Act 2004. law enforcement officer has the same meaning as in the Surveillance Devices Act 2004. lawfully obtained in Australia has a meaning affected by subsection 25A(3)." ;
