concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "5 Subsection 6(1)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-5 ;
    values:originalText "Insert: International Criminal Court has the same meaning as ICC in the International Criminal Court Act 2002. War Crimes Tribunal has the same meaning as Tribunal in the International War Crimes Tribunals Act 1995.  Assistance to international courts and tribunals  Schedule 1 Lawfully obtained material  Part 1  No. 34, 2018 Crimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and Other Measures) Act 2018" ;
    skos:definition "Insert: International Criminal Court has the same meaning as ICC in the International Criminal Court Act 2002. War Crimes Tribunal has the same meaning as Tribunal in the International War Crimes Tribunals Act 1995.  Assistance to international courts and tribunals  Schedule 1 Lawfully obtained material  Part 1  No. 34, 2018 Crimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and Other Measures) Act 2018"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "30e7c3d179f59f019a9056bcd2096a7734ebe8f549d14d9f86484d1a19f63831" ;
    cof:pageNumber "12"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Defines terms for international courts and tribunals" ;
