concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-8 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "8 After paragraph 68(l)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-8 ;
    values:originalText "Insert:  (la) if the Attorney-General has authorised the provision of the information to the International Criminal Court under section 69A of the International Criminal Court Act 2002— to:  (i) that Court; or  (ii) the Secretary of the Department for the purpose of providing the information to that Court; and  (lb) if the Attorney-General has authorised the provision of the information to a War Crimes Tribunal under section 25A of the International War Crimes Tribunals Act 1995—to:  (i) that Tribunal; or  Schedule 1  Assistance to international courts and tribunals" ;
    skos:definition "Insert:  (la) if the Attorney-General has authorised the provision of the information to the International Criminal Court under section 69A of the International Criminal Court Act 2002— to:  (i) that Court; or  (ii) the Secretary of the Department for the purpose of providing the information to that Court; and  (lb) if the Attorney-General has authorised the provision of the information to a War Crimes Tribunal under section 25A of the International War Crimes Tribunals Act 1995—to:  (i) that Tribunal; or  Schedule 1  Assistance to international courts and tribunals"@en ;
