    values:originalText "The report must set out the number of occasions on which lawfully intercepted information or interception warrant information was communicated to any of the following:  (a) a foreign country under paragraph 68(l) or section 68A;  (b) the International Criminal Court under paragraph 68(la) or section 68A;  Assistance to international courts and tribunals  Schedule 1 Lawfully obtained material  Part 1  No. 34, 2018 Crimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and Other Measures) Act 2018  (c) a War Crimes Tribunal under paragraph 68(lb) or section 68A." ;
    skos:definition "The report must set out the number of occasions on which lawfully intercepted information or interception warrant information was communicated to any of the following:  (a) a foreign country under paragraph 68(l) or section 68A;  (b) the International Criminal Court under paragraph 68(la) or section 68A;  Assistance to international courts and tribunals  Schedule 1 Lawfully obtained material  Part 1  No. 34, 2018 Crimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and Other Measures) Act 2018  (c) a War Crimes Tribunal under paragraph 68(lb) or section 68A."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b60bbff5501b6d7d96cd252f6f4d088f8683f370ced06c8304c11c27b9a80a4c" ;
    cof:pageNumber "14"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Report must set out communication of intercepted information to certain entities." ;
    dc:description "Yes" ;
