    values:originalText "Insert: carrier has the same meaning as in the Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979 (other than Part 5-4 or 5-4A of that Act)." ;
    skos:definition "Insert: carrier has the same meaning as in the Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979 (other than Part 5-4 or 5-4A of that Act)."@en ;
