concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-70 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "70 Application of amendments"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-70 ;
    values:originalText "The amendments made by this Part apply in relation to a disclosure of information or documents on or after the commencement of this item:  (a) whether the information or documents were acquired before, on or after that commencement; and  (b) whether conduct, a crime or an offence to which the disclosure relates occurred before, on or after that commencement.  Schedule 1  Assistance to international courts and tribunals" ;
    skos:definition "The amendments made by this Part apply in relation to a disclosure of information or documents on or after the commencement of this item:  (a) whether the information or documents were acquired before, on or after that commencement; and  (b) whether conduct, a crime or an offence to which the disclosure relates occurred before, on or after that commencement.  Schedule 1  Assistance to international courts and tribunals"@en ;
