concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-84 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "84 Subsection 6(1)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-84 ;
    values:originalText "Insert: international assistance application means an application for a surveillance device warrant made under an international assistance authorisation. international assistance authorisation means:  (a) an authorisation under subsection 15CA(1) of the Mutual Assistance in Criminal Matters Act 1987; or  (b) an authorisation under subsection 79A(1) of the International Criminal Court Act 2002; or  (c) an authorisation under subsection 32A(1) of the International War Crimes Tribunals Act 1995." ;
    skos:definition "Insert: international assistance application means an application for a surveillance device warrant made under an international assistance authorisation. international assistance authorisation means:  (a) an authorisation under subsection 15CA(1) of the Mutual Assistance in Criminal Matters Act 1987; or  (b) an authorisation under subsection 79A(1) of the International Criminal Court Act 2002; or  (c) an authorisation under subsection 32A(1) of the International War Crimes Tribunals Act 1995."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a4d2a08698b5b17d79acd3b577c9b50ec8d10bb3f989044e55470d202a059995" ;
