concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-90 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "90 Paragraph 16(2)(ea)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-90 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:  (ea) in the case of a warrant sought in relation to an international assistance authorisation—the likely evidentiary or intelligence value of any evidence or information sought to be obtained, to the extent that this is possible to determine from information obtained from the international entity to which the authorisation relates; and  Assistance to international courts and tribunals  Schedule 1 Use of surveillance devices  Part 6  No. 34, 2018 Crimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and Other Measures) Act 2018" ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:  (ea) in the case of a warrant sought in relation to an international assistance authorisation—the likely evidentiary or intelligence value of any evidence or information sought to be obtained, to the extent that this is possible to determine from information obtained from the international entity to which the authorisation relates; and  Assistance to international courts and tribunals  Schedule 1 Use of surveillance devices  Part 6  No. 34, 2018 Crimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and Other Measures) Act 2018"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6cdbaa9aeaa9b8f3cb5fe61031ca76cc804de2a7aac5b18066cf5f1eced6e371" ;
    cof:pageNumber "40"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Determine the likely evidentiary or intelligence value of evidence sought to be obtained from an international entity." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
