concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-94 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "94 Paragraph 21(5)(c)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-94 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:  (c) if the warrant was issued in relation to an international assistance authorisation—of enabling evidence to be obtained of:  (i) the commission of any offence to which the authorisation relates; or  (ii) the identity or location of the persons suspected of committing the offence;" ;
