concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-110 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "110 Subsection 23WA(9)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-110 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the subsection, substitute: Requests by a foreign country, international tribunal or foreign law enforcement agency  (9) The provisions of this Part apply in relation to a forensic procedure carried out because of a request by a foreign country, international tribunal or foreign law enforcement agency, as if a reference to an indictable offence were a reference to a foreign serious offence." ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the subsection, substitute: Requests by a foreign country, international tribunal or foreign law enforcement agency  (9) The provisions of this Part apply in relation to a forensic procedure carried out because of a request by a foreign country, international tribunal or foreign law enforcement agency, as if a reference to an indictable offence were a reference to a foreign serious offence."@en ;
