concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-127 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "127 Section 23YKA"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-127 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the section, substitute: 23YKA  Application of sections 23YI to 23YK  To avoid doubt, sections 23YI to 23YK do not apply in relation to a proceeding in a foreign country or international tribunal in which forensic evidence is provided in response to a request by:  (a) a foreign country; or  (b) an international tribunal; or  (c) a foreign law enforcement agency." ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the section, substitute: 23YKA  Application of sections 23YI to 23YK  To avoid doubt, sections 23YI to 23YK do not apply in relation to a proceeding in a foreign country or international tribunal in which forensic evidence is provided in response to a request by:  (a) a foreign country; or  (b) an international tribunal; or  (c) a foreign law enforcement agency."@en ;
