    values:originalText "Insert: child has the same meaning as in Part ID of the Crimes Act 1914. constable has the same meaning as in the Crimes Act 1914. forensic evidence has the same meaning as in Part ID of the Crimes Act 1914. forensic material has the same meaning as in Part ID of the Crimes Act 1914. forensic procedure has the same meaning as in Part ID of the Crimes Act 1914. incapable person has the same meaning as in Part ID of the Crimes Act 1914. parent has the same meaning as in the Crimes Act 1914." ;
