concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-156 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "156 Subsection 86(1)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-156 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  (1) An authorised officer may apply for a production order under the Proceeds of Crime Act in respect of the crime that is the subject of the proceeds request, if authorised to do so by the Attorney-General under section 81A.  Assistance to international courts and tribunals  Schedule 1 Proceeds of crime  Part 8  No. 34, 2018 Crimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and Other Measures) Act 2018" ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  (1) An authorised officer may apply for a production order under the Proceeds of Crime Act in respect of the crime that is the subject of the proceeds request, if authorised to do so by the Attorney-General under section 81A.  Assistance to international courts and tribunals  Schedule 1 Proceeds of crime  Part 8  No. 34, 2018 Crimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and Other Measures) Act 2018"@en ;
