    values:originalText "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  (5) This section does not apply to property that has been seized under a POCA search warrant because:  (a) it is evidential material; or  (b) it is property of a kind referred to in subparagraph 99A(a)(iv) or (v)." ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  (5) This section does not apply to property that has been seized under a POCA search warrant because:  (a) it is evidential material; or  (b) it is property of a kind referred to in subparagraph 99A(a)(iv) or (v)."@en ;
