concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-188 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "188 Subsection 101(6)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-188 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  (6) If the court is satisfied that the responsible enforcement agency head requires the property to be retained to give effect to the proceeds request, the court may make an order that the responsible enforcement agency head may retain the property for so long as the property is so required." ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  (6) If the court is satisfied that the responsible enforcement agency head requires the property to be retained to give effect to the proceeds request, the court may make an order that the responsible enforcement agency head may retain the property for so long as the property is so required."@en ;
