concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-102-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "102 Dealing with evidential material and certain property or things"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-102-2 ;
    values:originalText "seized under POCA search warrants  (1) This section applies if:  (a) property or a thing (the seized item) is seized under a POCA search warrant in relation to a crime within the jurisdiction of the ICC; and  (b) the seized item is:  (i) evidential material; or  (ii) property or a thing of a kind referred to in subparagraph 99A(a)(iv); and  (c) the seized item is seized by a person (the seizing officer) who is:  (i) an authorised officer; or  Schedule 1  Assistance to international courts and tribunals" ;
    skos:definition "seized under POCA search warrants  (1) This section applies if:  (a) property or a thing (the seized item) is seized under a POCA search warrant in relation to a crime within the jurisdiction of the ICC; and  (b) the seized item is:  (i) evidential material; or  (ii) property or a thing of a kind referred to in subparagraph 99A(a)(iv); and  (c) the seized item is seized by a person (the seizing officer) who is:  (i) an authorised officer; or  Schedule 1  Assistance to international courts and tribunals"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "896d762c5e22201cb32245d4697035f1f4c062727cc946db0dc3e7c5066da980" ;
