concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-202 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "202 Section 4 (definition of evidential material)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-202 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the definition, substitute: evidential material means:  (a) in Subdivision F of Division 6 of Part 4—evidence relating to:  (i) property in relation to which a forfeiture order has been or could be made; or  Schedule 1  Assistance to international courts and tribunals" ;
