concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-40ak a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "40AK Making false statements in applications"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-40ak ;
    values:originalText "A person commits an offence if:  Assistance to international courts and tribunals  Schedule 1 Proceeds of crime  Part 8  No. 34, 2018 Crimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and Other Measures) Act 2018  (a) the person makes a statement (whether orally, in a document or in any other way); and  (b) the statement:  (i) is false or misleading; or  (ii) omits any matter or thing without which the statement is misleading; and  (c) the statement is made in, or in connection with, a notice under section 40AH. Penalty: Imprisonment for 12 months or 60 penalty units, or both." ;
    skos:definition "A person commits an offence if:  Assistance to international courts and tribunals  Schedule 1 Proceeds of crime  Part 8  No. 34, 2018 Crimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and Other Measures) Act 2018  (a) the person makes a statement (whether orally, in a document or in any other way); and  (b) the statement:  (i) is false or misleading; or  (ii) omits any matter or thing without which the statement is misleading; and  (c) the statement is made in, or in connection with, a notice under section 40AH. Penalty: Imprisonment for 12 months or 60 penalty units, or both."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "bebfc6e15ccccfcd5330d1aced68b64ac95d1a7cc96fb1c2d769b0e9b2d5e5e2" ;
    cof:pageNumber "78"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Making false statements in applications is prohibited." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018.pdf> ;
