concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-40ao a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "40AO Passing on information given under monitoring orders"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-40ao ;
    values:originalText "If an enforcement agency is given information under a monitoring order made in relation to the Tribunal offence, the enforcement agency must, as soon as practicable after receiving the information, pass the information on to:  (a) the Attorney-General; or  (b) an APS employee who is in the Department and who is specified by the Attorney-General by written notice to the enforcement agency.  Assistance to international courts and tribunals  Schedule 1 Proceeds of crime  Part 8  No. 34, 2018 Crimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and Other Measures) Act 2018  Subdivision F—Search warrants relating to proceeds of crime and evidential material" ;
    skos:definition "If an enforcement agency is given information under a monitoring order made in relation to the Tribunal offence, the enforcement agency must, as soon as practicable after receiving the information, pass the information on to:  (a) the Attorney-General; or  (b) an APS employee who is in the Department and who is specified by the Attorney-General by written notice to the enforcement agency.  Assistance to international courts and tribunals  Schedule 1 Proceeds of crime  Part 8  No. 34, 2018 Crimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and Other Measures) Act 2018  Subdivision F—Search warrants relating to proceeds of crime and evidential material"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b5149bb7ed770c311c1ed8f060ac634284e52f2a1f7cad9b33845f143711b4f0" ;
    cof:pageNumber "80"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Pass on information to Attorney-General or APS employee" ;
    dc:description "true" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018.pdf> ;
