concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-40at a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "40AT Dealing with certain seized property"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-40at ;
    values:originalText "(1) Property must be dealt with in accordance with this section if:  (a) it has been seized under a POCA search warrant in relation to a Tribunal offence; and  (b) it is not:  Schedule 1  Assistance to international courts and tribunals" ;
    skos:definition "(1) Property must be dealt with in accordance with this section if:  (a) it has been seized under a POCA search warrant in relation to a Tribunal offence; and  (b) it is not:  Schedule 1  Assistance to international courts and tribunals"@en ;
