    cof:title "40AT Dealing with certain seized property" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(1) Property must be dealt with in accordance with this section if:  (a) it has been seized under a POCA search warrant in relation to a Tribunal offence; and  (b) it is not:  Schedule 1  Assistance to international courts and tribunals" ;
