concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-212 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "212 Application of amendments"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-212 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The amendments made by this Division apply in relation to a proceeds request made by a Tribunal to the Attorney-General:  (a) on or after the commencement of this item; or  (b) before the commencement of this item, if, immediately before that commencement, the Attorney-General had yet to make a decision on the request. (2) The amendments so apply:  (a) whether property or a thing to which the proceeds request relates was acquired before, on or after that commencement; and  (b) whether conduct or an offence to which the proceeds request relates occurred before, on or after that commencement.  Schedule 1  Assistance to international courts and tribunals" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The amendments made by this Division apply in relation to a proceeds request made by a Tribunal to the Attorney-General:  (a) on or after the commencement of this item; or  (b) before the commencement of this item, if, immediately before that commencement, the Attorney-General had yet to make a decision on the request. (2) The amendments so apply:  (a) whether property or a thing to which the proceeds request relates was acquired before, on or after that commencement; and  (b) whether conduct or an offence to which the proceeds request relates occurred before, on or after that commencement.  Schedule 1  Assistance to international courts and tribunals"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f4dc2eeb9b262f0011a07be716fe6c9caf41122c01f301aa849b5574bef8c12e" ;
    cof:pageNumber "87"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Amendments apply in relation to proceeds requests made by Tribunals to the Attorney-General." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018.pdf> ;
    dc:source "crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018.pdf, p.87" ;
    cml:asserts concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-212-norm .
concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-212-norm a values:Undertaking ;
    cml:modality cml:Deontic ;
    values:partOf concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-212 ;
    values:deonticStatus values:HeuristicDerived ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed .
doc:sch-1-sec-212 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "212 Application of amendments" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The amendments made by this Division apply in relation to a proceeds request made by a Tribunal to the Attorney-General:  (a) on or after the commencement of this item; or  (b) before the commencement of this item, if, immediately before that commencement, the Attorney-General had yet to make a decision on the request. (2) The amendments so apply:  (a) whether property or a thing to which the proceeds request relates was acquired before, on or after that commencement; and  (b) whether conduct or an offence to which the proceeds request relates occurred before, on or after that commencement.  Schedule 1  Assistance to international courts and tribunals" ;
    cof:pageNumber "87"^^xsd:integer .

