    values:originalText "The amendments made by this Part apply in relation to giving help on or after the commencement of this item, whether conduct, a crime or an offence to which the help relates occurred before, on or after that commencement.  Amendments relating to mutual assistance in criminal matters  Schedule 2 Search warrants  Part 1  No. 34, 2018 Crimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and Other Measures) Act 2018" ;
