concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-2-sec-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "2 Subsection 3(1) (definition of evidential material)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-2 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the definition, substitute: evidential material means:  (a) in Subdivision F of Division 2 of Part VI—evidence relating to:  (i) property in relation to which a foreign forfeiture order or foreign restraining order has been or could be made; or  (ii) property of a person in relation to whom a foreign pecuniary penalty order has been or could be made; or  (iii) tainted property; or  (iv) benefits derived from the commission of a foreign serious offence; or  (b) otherwise—a thing relevant to a proceeding or investigation, including such a thing in electronic form." ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the definition, substitute: evidential material means:  (a) in Subdivision F of Division 2 of Part VI—evidence relating to:  (i) property in relation to which a foreign forfeiture order or foreign restraining order has been or could be made; or  (ii) property of a person in relation to whom a foreign pecuniary penalty order has been or could be made; or  (iii) tainted property; or  (iv) benefits derived from the commission of a foreign serious offence; or  (b) otherwise—a thing relevant to a proceeding or investigation, including such a thing in electronic form."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6fb7521d1b1083568b0e2125f2cc27556fa8565265b8ffe8db54224a579f2bbf" ;
