concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-2-sec-40 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "40 Application provisions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-40 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The amendments of the Mutual Assistance in Criminal Matters Act 1987 made by items 30 to 34 of this Part apply in relation to a foreign forfeiture order, foreign pecuniary penalty order or foreign restraining order made before, on or after the commencement of this item.  Amendments relating to mutual assistance in criminal matters  Schedule 2 Other amendments  Part 3  No. 34, 2018 Crimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and Other Measures) Act 2018  (2) Subsection 34W(2) of the Mutual Assistance in Criminal Matters Act 1987, as inserted by this Part, applies in relation to a notice given on or after the commencement of this item.  Schedule 3  Amendment of the Extradition Act 1988  Crimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and Other Measures) Act 2018 No. 34, 2018" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The amendments of the Mutual Assistance in Criminal Matters Act 1987 made by items 30 to 34 of this Part apply in relation to a foreign forfeiture order, foreign pecuniary penalty order or foreign restraining order made before, on or after the commencement of this item.  Amendments relating to mutual assistance in criminal matters  Schedule 2 Other amendments  Part 3  No. 34, 2018 Crimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and Other Measures) Act 2018  (2) Subsection 34W(2) of the Mutual Assistance in Criminal Matters Act 1987, as inserted by this Part, applies in relation to a notice given on or after the commencement of this item.  Schedule 3  Amendment of the Extradition Act 1988  Crimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and Other Measures) Act 2018 No. 34, 2018"@en ;
