concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-3-sec-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3 Application of amendments"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-3 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The amendment of section 26 of the Extradition Act 1988 made by this Schedule applies in relation to surrender warrants issued after the commencement of this item.  (2) The amendment of section 35 of the Extradition Act 1988 made by this Schedule applies in relation to an order referred to in  Amendment of the Extradition Act 1988  Schedule 3  No. 34, 2018 Crimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and Other Measures) Act 2018  paragraph 35(7)(a) or (b) made after the commencement of this item.  Schedule 4  Amendments relating to foreign evidence  Crimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and Other Measures) Act 2018 No. 34, 2018" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The amendment of section 26 of the Extradition Act 1988 made by this Schedule applies in relation to surrender warrants issued after the commencement of this item.  (2) The amendment of section 35 of the Extradition Act 1988 made by this Schedule applies in relation to an order referred to in  Amendment of the Extradition Act 1988  Schedule 3  No. 34, 2018 Crimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and Other Measures) Act 2018  paragraph 35(7)(a) or (b) made after the commencement of this item.  Schedule 4  Amendments relating to foreign evidence  Crimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and Other Measures) Act 2018 No. 34, 2018"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "46da14fe4420f3aff35aee96bf477f22e87bfdc1e438f86f55f3d63409085139" ;
