concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-4-sec-27aa a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "27AA Evidentiary certificates relating to requests made to foreign"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-27aa ;
    values:originalText "countries  (1) The Attorney-General may issue a written certificate signed by the Attorney-General certifying that specified documents or things  Amendments relating to foreign evidence  Schedule 4  No. 34, 2018 Crimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and Other Measures) Act 2018  were obtained as a result of a request made to a foreign country by or on behalf of the Attorney-General.  (2) In any terrorism-related proceeding, a certificate under subsection (1) is prima facie evidence of the matters stated in the certificate." ;
    skos:definition "countries  (1) The Attorney-General may issue a written certificate signed by the Attorney-General certifying that specified documents or things  Amendments relating to foreign evidence  Schedule 4  No. 34, 2018 Crimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and Other Measures) Act 2018  were obtained as a result of a request made to a foreign country by or on behalf of the Attorney-General.  (2) In any terrorism-related proceeding, a certificate under subsection (1) is prima facie evidence of the matters stated in the certificate."@en ;
