concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-4-sec-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "6 Application provision"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-6 ;
    values:originalText "The amendments of the Foreign Evidence Act 1994 made by items 1 and 2 of this Schedule apply in relation to a proceeding that commences before, on or after the commencement of this item.  Schedule 5  Protecting vulnerable persons  Crimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and Other Measures) Act 2018 No. 34, 2018" ;
    skos:definition "The amendments of the Foreign Evidence Act 1994 made by items 1 and 2 of this Schedule apply in relation to a proceeding that commences before, on or after the commencement of this item.  Schedule 5  Protecting vulnerable persons  Crimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and Other Measures) Act 2018 No. 34, 2018"@en ;
