    skos:prefLabel "6 At the end of item 93 of Schedule 2"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-5-sec-6 ;
    values:originalText "Add: (2) The amendments made by Part 1 of this Schedule also apply in relation to proceedings instituted after the commencement of Schedule 5 to the Crimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and Other Measures) Act 2018 (whether the proceedings are for offences  Protecting vulnerable persons  Schedule 5  No. 34, 2018 Crimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and Other Measures) Act 2018  committed, or alleged to have been committed, before or after the commencement of this Schedule).  Schedule 6  Slavery-like offences and relevant evidence" ;
