    cof:title "24 Paragraphs 270.10(2)(a) and (b) of the Criminal Code" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "Omit “the alleged victim and the alleged offender”, substitute “the alleged victim, the alleged offender or a family member of the alleged victim or alleged offender, and any other person”." ;
    cof:pageNumber "110"^^xsd:integer .

