concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-7-sec-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "2 Application of amendments"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-7-sec-2 ;
    values:originalText "Section 21 of the War Crimes Act 1945, as substituted by this Schedule, applies in relation to the financial year starting on 1 July 2016 and each later financial year.  Schedule 8  Amendment of the Australian Federal Police Act 1979" ;
    skos:definition "Section 21 of the War Crimes Act 1945, as substituted by this Schedule, applies in relation to the financial year starting on 1 July 2016 and each later financial year.  Schedule 8  Amendment of the Australian Federal Police Act 1979"@en ;
