concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-8-sec-15 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15 At the end of section 40P"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-8-sec-15 ;
    values:originalText "Add:  (2) Despite subsection 14(2) of the Legislation Act 2003, regulations made for the purposes of section 40LA, 40M or 40N may make provision in relation to a matter by applying, adopting or incorporating any matter contained in a standard published by, or on behalf of, Standards Australia or published jointly by, or on behalf of, Standards Australia and Standards New Zealand:  (a) as in force or existing at a particular time; or  (b) as in force or existing from time to time.  Schedule 8  Amendment of the Australian Federal Police Act 1979" ;
    skos:definition "Add:  (2) Despite subsection 14(2) of the Legislation Act 2003, regulations made for the purposes of section 40LA, 40M or 40N may make provision in relation to a matter by applying, adopting or incorporating any matter contained in a standard published by, or on behalf of, Standards Australia or published jointly by, or on behalf of, Standards Australia and Standards New Zealand:  (a) as in force or existing at a particular time; or  (b) as in force or existing from time to time.  Schedule 8  Amendment of the Australian Federal Police Act 1979"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b0779ece02a6663f626afc08e81482393983544670eb9e8fb1a81020826a95e1" ;
    cof:pageNumber "117"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Allows regulations to incorporate standards published by Standards Australia or its partners." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
