concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-9-sec-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "2 After paragraph 54(1)(a)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-9-sec-2 ;
    values:originalText "Insert:  (aa) if the movement of the physical currency is to be effected by a person taking the physical currency out of Australia with the person, and the report is to be given using an electronic system referred to in subsection 53(9)—within the period prescribed by the AML/CTF Rules (which must end at or before the time worked out under subsection (3)); or" ;
    skos:definition "Insert:  (aa) if the movement of the physical currency is to be effected by a person taking the physical currency out of Australia with the person, and the report is to be given using an electronic system referred to in subsection 53(9)—within the period prescribed by the AML/CTF Rules (which must end at or before the time worked out under subsection (3)); or"@en ;
