doc:sch-9-sec-5 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "5 Application of amendments" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "The amendments made by this Part apply in relation to a movement of physical currency out of Australia after the commencement of this Schedule.  Schedule 9  Amendment of the Anti-Money Laundering and Counter-Terrorism Financing Act 2006" ;
    cof:pageNumber "121"^^xsd:integer .

