concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-9-sec-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "7 Application of amendment"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-9-sec-7 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The amendment of section 5 of the Anti-Money Laundering and Counter-Terrorism Financing Act 2006 made by this Part applies in relation to disclosures of, and access to, information after this item commences, whether the information was obtained before, on or after that commencement. (2) For the purposes of the Anti-Money Laundering and Counter-Terrorism Financing Act 2006, if information is disclosed in accordance with a provision of that Act to an official of the Australian Charities and Not-for-profits Commission before this item commences, the information is taken to have been disclosed to an official of a designated agency.  Amendment of the Australian Crime Commission Act 2002  Schedule 10  No. 34, 2018 Crimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and Other Measures) Act 2018" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The amendment of section 5 of the Anti-Money Laundering and Counter-Terrorism Financing Act 2006 made by this Part applies in relation to disclosures of, and access to, information after this item commences, whether the information was obtained before, on or after that commencement. (2) For the purposes of the Anti-Money Laundering and Counter-Terrorism Financing Act 2006, if information is disclosed in accordance with a provision of that Act to an official of the Australian Charities and Not-for-profits Commission before this item commences, the information is taken to have been disclosed to an official of a designated agency.  Amendment of the Australian Crime Commission Act 2002  Schedule 10  No. 34, 2018 Crimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and Other Measures) Act 2018"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "38a049e9a2a05d3a8d78b56e44247df8fb5573a8a01272ce9e94b4808cd0725f" ;
    cof:pageNumber "122"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Amendment of section 5 of the Anti-Money Laundering and Counter-Terrorism Financing Act 2006" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
