concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-10-sec-1 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "1 After subsection 4(1)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-10-sec-1 ;
    values:originalText "Insert:  (1A) For all purposes, if an expression defined in subsection (1) contains “ACC”, the expression when used as so defined may also be referred to by replacing “ACC” with any name or acronym specified under subsection 7(1A). Example: Expressions to which this subsection applies, including the following, may be used in a document by replacing “ACC” with any name or acronym by which the ACC may also be known: (a) ACC information; (b) ACC operation/investigation; (c) member of the staff of the ACC.  (1B) Subsection (1A) does not limit subsection 7(1A)." ;
    skos:definition "Insert:  (1A) For all purposes, if an expression defined in subsection (1) contains “ACC”, the expression when used as so defined may also be referred to by replacing “ACC” with any name or acronym specified under subsection 7(1A). Example: Expressions to which this subsection applies, including the following, may be used in a document by replacing “ACC” with any name or acronym by which the ACC may also be known: (a) ACC information; (b) ACC operation/investigation; (c) member of the staff of the ACC.  (1B) Subsection (1A) does not limit subsection 7(1A)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8445d5cfe714f4491bdd7be3a32948e53e2a96ef2d6d75ca8d501fbc73a359c4" ;
    cof:pageNumber "123"^^xsd:integer ;
